  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was a thing in Utah that year that nobody named above a whisper.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.49
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A man who spoke against the Church went out of his door and did not come back.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.25,
      "seconds": 4.05
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The lonely ranches had a name for the riders. The Avenging Angels.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 9.833,
      "seconds": 5.38
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Three weeks after Jefferson Hope rode for Nevada, John Ferrier heard his own gate click.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.125,
      "seconds": 5.77
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A stout sandy-haired man was coming up the path, and Ferrier knew him at once.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.417,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was Brigham Young himself, and a visit from the Prophet boded no man any good.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.417,
      "seconds": 5.68
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He took Ferrier's greeting coldly and went past him into the house.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 35.625,
      "seconds": 4.2
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "brigham_young",
      "text": "Brother Ferrier. Where are your wives?",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 40.333,
      "seconds": 2.49
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Ferrier had never married, and had never said why. He had his daughter.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 43.333,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The true believers had fed him in the desert and made him rich, and Young said so.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 48.917,
      "seconds": 5.63
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was of the daughter that the Prophet had come to speak.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 55.583,
      "seconds": 2.92
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There were stories, he said, that she was promised to a Gentile.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 59.042,
      "seconds": 4.63
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "And the thirteenth rule of Joseph Smith let no maiden of the faith wed outside it.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 64.208,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "brigham_young",
      "text": "Stangerson has a son. Drebber has a son. Let her choose.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 70.708,
      "seconds": 4.92
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "Give us time. My daughter is very young.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 76.167,
      "seconds": 3.13
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She should have a month, he said, and at the end of it her answer.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 82.333,
      "seconds": 4.16
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "brigham_young",
      "text": "It were better you and she lay bleached skeletons on the Sierra Blanco than defy the Holy Four.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 88.5,
      "seconds": 5.42
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "His voice rang through the house, and his daughter heard every word of it.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 94.458,
      "seconds": 5.06
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Ferrier heard his heavy step going away down the shingle.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 103.542,
      "seconds": 3.86
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The Council of Four had decided it, and the girl had a month.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 107.917,
      "seconds": 3.75
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He sat on till the lamp was lit, and then a soft hand was laid on his.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 112.167,
      "seconds": 5.13
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier",
      "text": "Oh, father, what shall we do?",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 117.833,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "Don't you scare yourself. We'll fix it up somehow.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 120.917,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She answered him with a sob, and with her hand tightening on his.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 125.375,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was a party leaving for Nevada in the morning. He would send Hope word.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 130.125,
      "seconds": 4.66
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "If he knew the young man, he would be back at a speed to whip the telegraph.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 135.292,
      "seconds": 4.49
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She laughed through her tears, and one heard such stories about those who opposed the Prophet.",
      "shot": 27,
      "at": 140.292,
      "seconds": 5.83
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_ferrier",
      "text": "I am a free-born American, and too old to knuckle under to any man.",
      "shot": 28,
      "at": 146.625,
      "seconds": 4.6
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "They had a clear month, he said. At the end of it they would leave Utah.",
      "shot": 29,
      "at": 152.333,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lucy_ferrier",
      "text": "But they won't let us leave.",
      "shot": 30,
      "at": 158.333,
      "seconds": 1.5
    }
  ]
}